cycle 1  12:48:49Z  canary-latency-rollback: in breach, waiting out the 90s hold (signal 2485 > 1000)
cycle 2  12:49:34Z  canary-latency-rollback: in breach, waiting out the 90s hold (signal 2485 > 1000)
